        "original_id": "5f7c9e07-7012-58b9-a2c4-ff71e3e819f0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mikael Åkerfeldt, Lee Ranaldo, Thurston Moore, Steven Wilson\n- Bands/Projects: Opeth, Bloodbath, Steel, Storm Corrosion, Sonic Youth\n- Publications/Lists: Rolling Stone, Spin, Greatest Guitarists of All Time\n\nFacts:\n- Lee Mark Ranaldo was born on February 3, 1956, and is an American musician, singer-songwriter, guitarist, writer, visual artist, and record producer.\n- Lars Mikael Åkerfeldt was born on 17 April 1974 and is a Swedish musician.\n- Lee Ranaldo is best known as a co-founder of the alternative rock band Sonic Youth.\n- Mikael Åkerfeldt is the lead vocalist, guitarist, and primary songwriter of the progressive death metal band Opeth.\n- Mikael Åkerfeldt is the former vocalist of the death metal supergroup Bloodbath.\n- Mikael Åkerfeldt was also guitarist for the one-off band Steel.\n- Mikael Åkerfeldt is part of the collaboration Storm Corrosion with Steven Wilson.\n- In 2004, Rolling Stone ranked Lee Ranaldo number 33 on its Greatest Guitarists of All Time list.\n- In May 2012, Spin ranked Thurston Moore and his Sonic Youth bandmate Lee Ranaldo together at number 1 in a staff-selected top 100 list.",
